Materials: any scrap yarn, size doesn't matter

-- "place marker" stashes the top of the stack under a name without
-- consuming it -- just like clipping a stitch marker into a loop.
-- "work into" a marker pushes a fresh copy of that value.

Row 1: ch 42, place marker "star"
Row 2: work into "star", pull through, work into "star", pull through, work into "star", pull through

FO
